This project interoperates with easyeda-agent by zhoushoujianwork and contributors:
https://github.com/zhoushoujianwork/easyeda-agent

The CLI, daemon, Connector extension, API catalog and upstream Skill remain
separately distributed upstream. No compiled Connector or drawing engine is
bundled here. Offline tests exercise its publicly documented composition and
Connectivity IR interfaces using synthetic data.

Upstream's overall MIT license has an Apache-2.0 exception for its beautify
components. Redistribution of upstream bundles requires upstream LICENSE and
NOTICE; see docs/RESEARCH.md. Manufacturer documents are linked, not redistributed.
